    skos:definition "The codec contract of menc:XZ, version 1: the decode kind, the parameters a processor accepts and the error categories it may raise for that concept, verified by vector suite version 1."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Read by processors and conformance tools to bind and check the hexplain:codecParameter values of an encoding step that names the concept. It is not a controlled value: profiles name the concept, never its contract."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#XZ.contract.concatenated> rdfs:label "XZ codec contract parameter concatenated"@en ;
    skos:definition "The concatenated parameter declared by the codec contract of menc:XZ: its type, whether it is required, and any default, bounds or allowed values."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Read by processors and conformance tools to bind and check the hexplain:codecParameter values of an encoding step that names the concept. It is not a controlled value: profiles name the concept, never its contract."@en .
